# Execute Task

Execute the next task.

Refer to the instructions located in @~/.agent-os/instructions/execute-tasks.md

## Project-Specific Standards

<testing>
  <framework>Flutter Test Framework</framework>
  <commands>
    - flutter test (run all tests)
    - flutter test test/specific_test.dart (run specific test file)
    - flutter test --coverage (run tests with coverage)
  </commands>
  <requirements>
    - Use Flutter CLI commands instead of generic test runners
    - Only run tests that were created or modified during task execution
    - Do NOT run the entire test suite as existing tests may have pre-existing errors
    - Ensure all newly created/modified tests pass before committing
    - Maintain test coverage for new code
  </requirements>
</testing>

<development_server>
  <framework>Flutter</framework>
  <commands>
    - flutter run (start development server)
    - flutter run --hot (enable hot reload)
  </commands>
  <check_command>ps aux | grep "flutter.*run"</check_command>
</development_server>
